Subject: [PATCH] Movie audio: preserve host media deadlines and expose device capture

Keep the offline movie's vblank deadlines through host stalls so its independent
48 kHz playback queue does not starve. The fight catch-up cap is unchanged.

Expose a host-only movie PCM active flag. Add opt-in capture of final device
callback samples and an explicitly labelled no-endpoint diagnostic host clock,
plus movie device consumption counters. Muted test runs still execute callbacks.
No guest state, serialization, hash masks, or net protocol changes.

